<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech 52-week T-bill auction averages 12.12 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech 52-week T-bill auction averages 12.12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank on Wednesday said its auction of five billion crowns in 52-week Finance Ministry treasury bills had an average yield of 12.12 percent and was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>Bids totalled 12.153 billion crowns, with the maximum accepted bid at 12.20 percent and the minimum accepted bid at 11.98 percent.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
